---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="About Suburble" description="Learn more about Suburble">
    <article>
        <h1 class="font-bold text-2xl">About Suburble</h1>
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
                <p>
                    Suburble is a game about guessing Melbourne suburbs. I made
                    Suburble for my friend Ria's birthday. She likes this game
                    called <a class="link" href="https://trainle.fun">Trainle</a
                    >, itself a game about guessing Melbourne train stations.
                </p>
                <p>
                    It might seem like a big undertaking to make a game for a
                    birthday, but anyone who knows Ria will understand how
                    completely amazing and wonderful she is. I hope she has a
                    lovely 21st :)
                </p>

                <p class="italic">
                    If you like Suburble, and would like to have a chat or give
                    me a job,
                    <a class="link" href="mailto:avadinhvu@gmail.com"
                        >send me an email.</a
                    >
                </p>

                <h3 class="font-bold">Other Games</h3>
                <p>
                    If you like Suburble, you might enjoy one of my <a
                        class="link"
                        href="https://crossword.blue">crosswords</a
                    >.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <img src="/assets/me_and_ria.webp" alt="Me and Ria" />
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="font-bold">Legal</h2>
            <p>
                This game uses geographic data from Open Street Maps. Etymology
                comes from <a
                    class="link"
                    href="https://maps.philipmallis.com/melbourne-suburb-names-etymology/"
                    >VicNames via the amazing Philip Mallis.</a
                > Housing prices come from the <a
                    class="link"
                    href="https://www.land.vic.gov.au/valuations/resources-and-reports/property-sales-statistics"
                >
                    Victorian government.</a
                > Population comes from the census via Wikidata. All images are public
                domain unless otherwise stated.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="font-bold">Technical</h2>
            <p>
                This website was built using Astro and Svelte. The map is made
                with MapLibreGL and <a
                    class="link"
                    href="https://openfreemap.org/">Open Free Map.</a
                >
            </p>
        </section>
    </article>
</PageLayout>

<style>
    p {
        padding-bottom: 1rem;
    }
</style>
